254
00:12:29,090 --> 00:12:36,270
Well, for example, when you ask a person their occupation, you can ask what they do for a living, but don't ask how much money they make.

255
00:12:36,430 --> 00:12:36,710
That's right.

256
00:12:36,830 --> 00:12:39,790
Anglo people are really sensitive about talking about money.

257
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,800
We hate talking about money.

258
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:42,190
Right.

259
00:12:42,330 --> 00:12:45,470
So, don't ask somebody their salary or how much money they make.

260
00:12:45,710 --> 00:12:47,650
It's just not considered to be polite.

261
00:12:48,150 --> 00:12:52,650
And another good one to be careful of is asking if someone is married or not.

262
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:53,460
Right.

263
00:12:53,680 --> 00:13:02,320
Sometimes you're just being friendly and you want to know if that person has family or something, but you have to be careful when and where you ask this question.

264
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:03,560
Right.

265
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:09,000
If they've mentioned their family, if they've talked about their kids or something else to do with their family, then it's okay.

266
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:09,440
Right.

267
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:11,380
You can say, well, oh, how long have you been married?

268
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:12,720
Yeah.

269
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:14,740
But if a guy asks a girl, oh, are you married?

270
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:23,020
It kind of sounds like maybe he's interested in her or that he's trying to come on to her and to be maybe more than friendly, right?

271
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:23,480
That's right.

272
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,360
Okay.

273
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:28,700
So, some great Small Talk tips and phrases here at EnglishPod.

274
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:36,160
Now, if you have any questions about this lesson or any other lessons, be sure to visit our website at EnglishPod.com.

275
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:42,220
And if you also have any doubts about which questions you think are appropriate of asking somebody, yeah, come into the website and let us know.

276
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,860
So, thanks for downloading, you guys.

277
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:46,020
And until next time, goodbye.
